@host = http://localhost:5080
@userId = 3f1c2b7e-9a4d-4c61-8e2f-5b0a7d9c1e44
# paste the slug returned by request 1
@slug = REPLACE_ME

### 1) Create — BATCH + INSERT + TTL (7 days)
POST {{host}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "url": "https://cassandra.apache.org", "ttlDays": 7 }

### 2) User's links — SELECT one partition, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/links?userId={{userId}}&limit=10

### 3) Follow — SELECT + counter UPDATE → 302
GET {{host}}/r/{{slug}}

### 4) Stats — counter + TTL left
GET {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}/stats

### 5) Update url — BATCH + UPDATE USING TTL
PUT {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/latest/" }

### 6) Delete — BATCH + DELETE (tombstones)
DELETE {{host}}/api/links/{{slug}}
